Error [jet.NotSerializable]: `Wrap<Plain>` can't be serialized
  --> serde_generic_noncodable_arg.jet:20:26
    |
 20 |     print(json.to_string(w))
    |                          ^
 Why: `Plain` has no wire form, so `Wrap<Plain>` has none
 Fix: Add `#[Codable]` or `#[Encode]` to `Plain`, or remove it from the encoded value
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2411
